# The item list opened by ITEMORD=LOC of the settings file, then Next
# order through every order and round to the first again; the frame
# minimized by its system menu, another program active then, and opened
# again shows the list as it was.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S LOC
K ALT-C R
S MFR
K ALT-C R
S SERIAL
K ALT-C R
S ID
K ALT-C R
S LOC2
K DOWN DOWN
S DOWN
K ALT-SPACE N
O
S OPENED
